[56.702036, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ parses a signature header with two v1 entries \u001b[90m(1.061742ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[56.702358, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ accepts a correctly signed body \u001b[90m(0.90766ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a body signed with the wrong secret \u001b[90m(0.629976ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a stale timestamp \u001b[90m(1.38067ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ policy: small INR refunds auto-approve, others go to review \u001b[90m(0.294092ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancelling a pending refund \u001b[90m(3.108542ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[56.703049, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ a redelivered event creates only one refund \u001b[90m(0.902307ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ authz: keys map to role permissions \u001b[90m(1.154151ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
